record.content:
\title{An Elementary Treatise on Quaternions} \date{1890}
\author{Peter Guthrie Tait}
\maketitle
\subsection{Table of Contents}
Preface: An Elementary Treatise On Quaternions
Chapter 1: Vectors and Their Composition \\ Chapter 2: Products and Quotients of Vectors \\ Chapter 3: Interpretations and Transformations of Quaternion Expressions \\ Chapter 4: Differentiation of Quaternions \\ Chapter 5: The Solution of Equations of the First Degree \\ Chapter 6: Sketch of the Analytical Theory of Quaternions \\ Chapter 7: Geometry of the Straight Line and Plane \\ Chapter 8: The Sphere and Cyclic Cone \\ Chapter 9: Surfaces of the Second Degree \\ Chapter 10: Geometry of Curves and Surfaces \\ Chapter 11: Kinematics \\ Chapter 12: Physical Applications \\ \\ \\ \\ \\
Copying this book will take some time, please let me know if you want to help.
